DLG 0
Welcome home, Tom!{wvy}Your passport is ready.{wvy}Talk to the guides near each door to learn about destinations.
NAME passport dialog

DLG 1
Progress Board:{wvy}Japan: {japan_ticket == 1 ? ✓ Visited : Ready}{wvy}Morocco: {morocco_ticket == 1 ? ✓ Visited : Ready}{wvy}Peru: {peru_ticket == 1 ? ✓ Visited : Ready}{wvy}{all_done == 1 ? All destinations explored! : Keep exploring!}
NAME progress dialog

DLG 2
This door leads to Japan!{wvy}Visit snowy shrines and zen gardens.{wvy}Step through to begin your journey.
NAME japan guide

DLG 3
This door leads to Morocco!{wvy}Explore vibrant markets and rooftop views.{wvy}Step through to begin your journey.
NAME morocco guide

DLG 4
This door leads to Peru!{wvy}Discover mountain paths and lush forests.{wvy}Step through to begin your journey.
NAME peru guide

DLG 5
↑ Continue forward
NAME exit forward

DLG 6
Welcome to Japan!{wvy}Follow the path north to explore the shrines and gardens.{wvy}Collect your ticket at the final location!
NAME japan entrance welcome

DLG 7
Welcome to our shrine.{wvy}Read the verses in order to complete the haiku.{wvy}When you're done, I'll stamp your passport.
NAME monk dialog

DLG 8
First verse of the haiku...
NAME verse 1

DLG 9
Second verse of the haiku...{wvy}The monk nods approvingly.
NAME verse 2

DLG 10
{japan_ticket == 0 ? You've reached the zen garden!{wvy}Here is your return ticket.{wvy}You'll be back home shortly.{japan_ticket = 1}{EXIT 0,7,12} : Welcome back to the garden!}
NAME japan ticket giver

DLG 11
Welcome to Morocco!{wvy}Follow the path to explore markets and rooftops.{wvy}Collect your ticket at the final location!
NAME morocco entrance welcome

DLG 12
Welcome to the market!{wvy}Browse our spices and crafts.{wvy}The rooftops above offer beautiful views!
NAME vendor dialog

DLG 13
{morocco_ticket == 0 ? You've reached the rooftop!{wvy}What a beautiful view of Marrakesh.{wvy}Here is your return ticket.{morocco_ticket = 1}{EXIT 0,7,12} : Welcome back to the rooftop!}
NAME morocco ticket giver

DLG 14
Welcome to Peru!{wvy}Follow the path through plazas and forests.{wvy}Collect your ticket at the final location!
NAME peru entrance welcome

DLG 15
Would you like a flower?{wvy}Take this beautiful bloom!{wvy}The mountain paths ahead are stunning!
NAME flower vendor

DLG 16
{peru_ticket == 0 ? You've reached the forest view!{wvy}The mountains of Peru are magnificent.{wvy}Here is your return ticket.{peru_ticket = 1}{EXIT 0,7,12} : Welcome back to the forest!}
NAME peru ticket giver

DLG 17
The path ahead leads to an ancient shrine.{wvy}In winter, the snow makes everything quiet and peaceful.{wvy}Take your time and enjoy the journey.
NAME japan snow guide

DLG 18
I come here every week to find peace.{wvy}Reading haiku helps me slow down.{wvy}Each poem is like a small meditation.
NAME japan visitor

DLG 19
Our textiles tell stories!{wvy}Each pattern has meaning passed down through generations.{wvy}The colors come from natural dyes.{wvy}Red for strength, blue for protection.
NAME morocco textiles

DLG 20
This is the best spot to watch the sunset!{wvy}Every evening, the sky turns golden.{wvy}People gather here to share tea and stories.{wvy}It's our favorite time of day.
NAME morocco sunset

DLG 21
Our traditions connect us to the mountains.{wvy}We honor Pachamama, Mother Earth.{wvy}Flowers are sacred offerings.{wvy}They show respect for nature's gifts.
NAME peru traditions

DLG 22
The forest is full of life!{wvy}You might see hummingbirds, llamas, or condors.{wvy}Each creature has its place in the mountains.{wvy}We protect them as our ancestors did.
NAME peru wildlife

DLG 23
Welcome to Japan!{wvy}The snow here is peaceful.{wvy}Shrines are sacred places where we find inner calm.{wvy}Haiku poetry helps us appreciate simple moments.
NAME japan traveler

DLG 24
In Japan, we value harmony and respect.{wvy}The shrine is a place of meditation.{wvy}Haiku poems have three lines: 5-7-5 syllables.{wvy}They capture nature's beauty in words.
NAME japan culture

DLG 25
Welcome to Marrakesh!{wvy}Our markets are full of life and color.{wvy}You'll find spices, textiles, and crafts.{wvy}The rooftops offer beautiful views of the city.
NAME morocco culture

DLG 26
Moroccan food is rich with spices!{wvy}We use cumin, cinnamon, and saffron.{wvy}Tagines are slow-cooked stews.{wvy}Mint tea is our traditional welcome drink.
NAME morocco food

DLG 27
From here you can see the whole medina!{wvy}The old city walls stretch far.{wvy}At sunset, the rooftops glow orange.{wvy}It's a magical place to watch the day end.
NAME morocco view

DLG 28
Welcome to Peru!{wvy}This plaza is the heart of our community.{wvy}Machu Picchu is an ancient Incan city.{wvy}It sits high in the mountains, hidden for centuries.
NAME peru culture

DLG 29
The Incas built amazing terraces here.{wvy}They farmed on mountain slopes.{wvy}Machu Picchu was a sacred site.{wvy}Flowers were offerings to the mountains.
NAME peru history

VAR japan_ticket
0

